Optional class

//create Optional

Optional.empty()
->represents empty box
->.get -> Exception: No value present

Optional.of(T t)
->use only when value is not-null
->if value is null-> .get -> Exception: NullPointerException (at the time of creation itself)

Optional.ofNullable(T t)
->use when value may or may not be null
->if value is null-> it returns Optional.empty() -> .get -> Exception: No value present

